        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgmGad_LI5kHBeQv3yPHzisf812dxFUEUeT9-Ws1rNoKBypfE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "After making me pay for the job completely upfront, they explained to me that they could respect my short delay times, in the end, they were five days late and the quality of the product was lackluster, arguably I could have done better painted aluminum in my own garage. Assembly was all crooked, refused to refund me, stay far away.",
        "time": 1764801074,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dr. Nigel Henton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110572971825056558676/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLC_kNn0lEZfPFq78bPQzxQFXYoT1btfzTwcpPColuhwWpC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I was initially upset with my installer, but now seeing the product that he was furnished by teqnicolor, i understand and see now that it was the manufacturer that messed up, whoever is in charge of quality control must be blind. Utterly disappointed.",
        "time": 1764801311,
        "translated": false
      },
